  "narrative": {
    "intro": "Valero Marketing and Supply has $483M in contract obligations in FY2026 to date. Valero Marketing and Supply has 98 awards so far this fiscal year, with an average award size of $4.9M. Valero Marketing and Supply obligations are down 59.1% year over year compared with the prior period. Historical obligations for Valero Marketing and Supply show a peak range between FY22 and FY25, with FY22 at $1.4B, FY23 at $1.2B, FY24 at $1.1B, and FY25 at $1.2B. Valero Marketing and Supply recorded $513M in FY21 and $483M in FY26 so far. Valero Marketing and Supply totals for the current fiscal year are partial and represent fiscal year to date obligations; award-value tables and expiring-contracts tables, where present, reflect total contract values rather than obligations. This snapshot highlights current-year scale, average award size, and the multi-year context needed to compare FY2026 to prior full fiscal years.",
